#: ../../tools/mesh_tools.rst:98 d54c04602d054c469f991a09dcb53769
msgid "**Name**: ``MeSH_search_terms``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mesh_tools.rst:100 8a4efffc9a194e9e85696f3116a919de
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search MeSH terms (entry terms/synonyms) by label. MeSH "
"terms include the preferred descriptor names as well as alternative entry"
" terms, synonyms, and common names. This is broader than descriptor "
"search and can find terms like 'heart attack' that map to the descriptor "
"'Myocardial Infarction'. Supports exact, contains, and startswith "
"matching. Example: searching 'tumor' returns terms like 'Tumors', 'Tumor "
"Growth', 'Tumors, Neoplastic'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mesh_tools.rst:104 4513d5cb6bae4024957f2c31ccfa5a12
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Term label to search for. Examples: "
"'tumor', 'heart attack', 'aspirin', 'blood pressure', 'DNA repair'."
msgstr ""

